{"status": 200, "url_final": "https://duanecilliers.github.io/atelier/", "html": "<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Atelier - Documentation</title>\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n\n<style>\n  :root{\n    --bg:#0a0a0a; --bg2:#0e0e0e; --surface:#111214; --surface2:#161719; --surface3:#1b1c1f;\n    --border:#1c1c1c; --border-strong:#2a2a2a; --hairline:#171717;\n    --text:#f2f2f2; --text2:#a0a0a0; --text3:#6a6a6a;\n    --accent:#f2f2f2;\n    --ok:#2fd36f; --warn:#ffb000; --err:#ff2d3f;\n    --ok-soft:color-mix(in oklab,var(--ok) 12%,transparent);\n    --mono:'JetBrains Mono',ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;\n  }\n  *,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box;}\n  :where(p,h1,h2,h3,li){overflow-wrap:anywhere;}\n  html{background:var(--bg);}\n  body{\n    margin:0;font-family:var(--mono);color:var(--text);background:var(--bg);\n    font-size:13px;line-height:1.55;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;letter-spacing:-0.01em;\n  }\n  .wrap{max-width:820px;margin:0 auto;padding:64px 28px 120px;}\n\n  .eyebrow{font-size:9.5px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.32em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--text3);margin:0 0 10px;}\n  .eyebrow::before{content:\"// \";color:var(--text3);}\n  h1{font-size:34px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.05em;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0 0 6px;line-height:1.1;}\n  h1 .caret{display:inline-block;width:12px;height:26px;background:var(--err);margin-left:8px;transform:translateY(4px);animation:blink 1.1s steps(1) infinite;}\n  @keyframes blink{50%{opacity:0;}}\n  .subttl{font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:0.24em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--text3);margin:0 0 20px;}\n  .lede{font-size:14.5px;color:var(--text2);max-width:72ch;margin:0 0 8px;line-height:1.6;}\n  .lede b{color:var(--text);font-weight:600;}\n\n  .cards{display:grid;gap:14px;margin-top:36px;}\n  a.card{display:block;border:1px solid var(--border);background:var(--surface);padding:20px 20px 18px;\n         text-decoration:none;transition:border-color .15s,background .15s;}\n  a.card:hover{border-color:var(--border-strong);background:var(--surface2);}\n  .card .kicker{font-size:9px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--text3);margin:0 0 10px;display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;}\n  .dot{width:6px;height:6px;flex:0 0 auto;display:inline-block;}\n  .dot.ok{background:var(--ok);} .dot.warn{background:var(--warn);}\n  .card h3{font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text);margin:0 0 6px;letter-spacing:0.01em;}\n  .card p{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--text2);margin:0;line-height:1.55;}\n  .card .go{font-size:10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--text3);margin-top:12px;display:inline-flex;gap:6px;align-items:center;}\n  a.card:hover .go{color:var(--text);}\n\n  .foot{margin-top:56px;border-top:1px solid var(--border);padding-top:16px;font-size:10.5px;color:var(--text3);letter-spacing:0.02em;}\n  .foot a{color:var(--text2);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px;text-decoration-color:var(--border-strong);}\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"wrap\">\n\n  <p class=\"eyebrow\">Atelier \u00b7 Software factory \u00b7 Documentation</p>\n  <h1>Atelier<span class=\"caret\"></span></h1>\n  <p class=\"subttl\">Agents propose \u00b7 deterministic code disposes</p>\n  <p class=\"lede\">Atelier is a software factory: a Python engine runs coding agents inside bounded phases and decides sequencing and acceptance; a web cockpit observes and controls it. The two halves meet at a single SQLite file that <i>is</i> the trace. These pages are the reader-facing companions to the in-repo docs.</p>\n\n  <div class=\"cards\">\n    <a class=\"card\" href=\"atelier-usage-guide.html\">\n      <p class=\"kicker\"><span class=\"dot ok\"></span> Field guide</p>\n      <h3>Using the Factory</h3>\n      <p>How to point Atelier at any codebase - stamp, wire the quality gate, scope a run, pick a workflow, and roll out safely from read-only recon to a full lifecycle.</p>\n      <span class=\"go\">Read the guide \u2192</span>\n    </a>\n    <a class=\"card\" href=\"atelier-skill-guide.html\">\n      <p class=\"kicker\"><span class=\"dot ok\"></span> Operator guide</p>\n      <h3>Building with the /atelier skill</h3>\n      <p>How to drive the factory in plain language: prompting the orchestrator, a gallery of copy-paste examples, and spawning sandboxes so a run lands on its own branch and opens a PR.</p>\n      <span class=\"go\">Read the operator guide \u2192</span>\n    </a>\n    <a class=\"card\" href=\"atelier-plan.html\">\n      <p class=\"kicker\"><span class=\"dot warn\"></span> Build plan</p>\n      <h3>Software Factory Build Plan</h3>\n      <p>The locked, phase-by-phase roadmap the factory is built from - foundations and the seam, observe, control plane, and the phases beyond.</p>\n      <span class=\"go\">Read the plan \u2192</span>\n    </a>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"foot\">\n    <p>Source and the long-form engineering guides live in the repository: <a href=\"https://github.com/duanecilliers/atelier\">github.com/duanecilliers/atelier</a> \u00b7 <a href=\"https://github.com/duanecilliers/atelier/tree/main/docs\">docs/README.md and the numbered guides</a>.</p>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n", "erro": "", "ms": 700}